OL,3,GNEWSAA63 fully reopens after lorry
OL,4,Abridge strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the A63 in East Yorkshire
OL,7,Fthat was closed after a lorry hit a
OL,8,Fbridge has fully reopened.
OL,10,FPolice were called to the Dale Road
OL,11,Fbridge in Elloughton at about 15:00 BST
OL,12,Fon Monday.
OL,14,FEarlier in the day, National Highways
OL,15,Fsaid the eastbound carriageway, which
OL,16,Fwas initially closed, had reopened
OL,17,Fafter being "confirmed safe for traffic
OL,18,Fto pass underneath".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
